{%- comment -%}
  Shopify protects contact forms with an invisible hCaptcha (no widget is shown unless a submission looks
  suspicious). This notice tells visitors the form is protected, as hCaptcha asks for in invisible mode.
{%- endcomment -%}
<p class="ts-form__captcha">
  This form is protected by hCaptcha. Its
  <a href="https://www.hcaptcha.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a> and
  <a href="https://www.hcaptcha.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Terms of Service</a> apply.
</p>
